      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "In the hallway he falls, knocks over the coat rack, there's a terrible crash and everything comes down: basins, skis, a bicycle...",
